| !MIDISynth boot file
| Tells programs where the General MIDI SoundFont is, and adds *MIDIPlay.
| The sound modules are loaded when needed, not at boot (see LoadSound).
Set MIDISynth$Dir <Obey$Dir>
IconSprites <MIDISynth$Dir>.!Sprites
IfThere <MIDISynth$Dir>.SoundFont Then Set MIDISynth$SoundFont <MIDISynth$Dir>.SoundFont
Set Alias$MIDIPlay Obey <MIDISynth$Dir>.Play %%*0
